<chapter xml:id="ch-data-display" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Displaying Quantitative Data</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>Before we can model data, we have to look at it. This chapter develops
    the graphical tools for describing how the values of a single quantitative
    variable are distributed.</p>
  </introduction>

